<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n111358" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῐλο-παίγμων</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ονος</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παίζω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fond of play,
				sportive,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρχηθμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					23.134
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρχηστῆρες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					198
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				333
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Them.
				<u>Or.</u>
				24.301c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Decl.</u>
				30.68
			</span></i>: of the lion, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὰ σύντροφα καὶ συνήθη σφόδρα φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					629b11
				</span></i>
			: epith. of Pan, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BCH</u>
				50.240
			</span></i> (Thasos, <span class="entity">iii/ii B. C.</span>). The more 
				Att.
			 form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιλοπαίσμων</span></b> 
			occurs in <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				452e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cra.</u>
				406c
			</span></i>; cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				5.161
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-μόνως</span> ibid.</div>
